        "transformations": {
          "files": [
            "src/solution.cpp"
          ],
          "retained": [
            "Deduplicate obstacles and order them by diagonal and row; use binomial path counts and obstacle inclusion-exclusion only when the distinct obstacle count is at most max(1, N/16).",
            "For larger obstacle sets, use a two-buffer anti-diagonal recurrence, processing contiguous free spans and applying GCC ivdep only to the dependency-free interior."
          ]
        },
